@meck_stre_coalition_menu
title: Mecklenburg-Strelitz Coalition Options

Current Parliamentary Situation:
{!<table>!}
{!<tr><td>SPD Seats:</th><td>**[+ spd_r_meck_stre +]**%</td></tr>!}
[? if kpd_r_meck_stre: {!<tr><td>KPD Seats:</td><td>**[+ kpd_r_meck_stre +]**%</td></tr>!} ?]
[? if sapd_r_meck_stre: {!<tr><td>SAPD Seats:</td><td>**[+ sapd_r_meck_stre +]**%</td></tr>!} ?]
[? if uspd_r_meck_stre: {!<tr><td>USPD Seats:</td><td>**[+ uspd_r_meck_stre +]**%</td></tr>!} ?]
{!</table>!}

Available Options:

- @social_liberal_coalition_meck_stre: Form a Social-Liberal Coalition [? if social_liberal_coalition_meck_stre >= 50: (Possible: [+ social_liberal_coalition_meck_stre +]%) ?][? if social_liberal_coalition_meck_stre < 50: (Only [+ social_liberal_coalition_meck_stre +]%) ?]
- @bourgeois_coalition_meck_stre: Form a Bourgeois Coalition [? if bourgeois_coalition_meck_stre >= 50: (Possible: [+ bourgeois_coalition_meck_stre +]%) ?][? if bourgeois_coalition_meck_stre < 50: (Only [+ bourgeois_coalition_meck_stre +]%) ?]
- @thick_bourgeois_coalition_meck_stre: Form a Broad Bourgeois Coalition (including DNVP) [? if thick_bourgeois_coalition_meck_stre >= 50: (Possible: [+ thick_bourgeois_coalition_meck_stre +]%) ?][? if thick_bourgeois_coalition_meck_stre < 50: (Only [+ thick_bourgeois_coalition_meck_stre +]%) ?]
- @left_coalition_meck_stre: Form a Left Coalition [? if left_coalition_meck_stre >= 50: (Possible: [+ left_coalition_meck_stre +]%) ?][? if left_coalition_meck_stre < 50: (Only [+ left_coalition_meck_stre +]%) ?]
- @spd_majority_meck_stre: Govern Alone (SPD Majority) [? if spd_r_meck_stre >= 50: (Possible) ?][? if spd_r_meck_stre < 50: (Not possible) ?]
- @right_wing_coalition_meck_stre: Right-Wing Coalition Forms [? if right_coalition_meck_stre >= 50: (Possible: [+ right_coalition_meck_stre +]%) ?]
- @meck_stre_minority_toleration_option: Form SPD Minority Government with Toleration
- @meck_stre_tolerate_bourgeois_option: Tolerate a Bourgeois Government
- @no_coalition_meck_stre: No Coalition Possible - New Elections
- @meck_stre_coalition_creator_option: Custom Coalition Creator

@meck_stre_minority_toleration_option
title: Form SPD Minority Government with Toleration
subtitle: We'll govern as a minority, seeking toleration from other parties.
on-arrival: meck_stre_gov = "SPD"; meck_stre_spd = 1; meck_stre_election_2_trigger_time = time + 30; meck_stre_coalition_r = spd_r_meck_stre; meck_stre_kpd = 0; meck_stre_sapd = 0; meck_stre_uspd = 0; meck_stre_ddp = 0; meck_stre_lvp = 0; meck_stre_dvp = 0; meck_stre_kvp = 0; meck_stre_vhg = 0; meck_stre_true_others = 0; meck_stre_wp = 0
go-to: meck_stre_toleration_selection

We'll need toleration from other parties to survive confidence votes.

@meck_stre_toleration_selection
title: Seek Toleration for SPD Minority Government

Current Government: <span style="color: [+ spd_colour +];">**SPD Minority**</span> ([+ meck_stre_coalition_r +]% support)
Government Stability: [+ meck_stre_election_2_trigger_time - time +] months

Parties currently:
[? if meck_stre_kpd == 2: <span style="color: [+ kpd_colour +];">KPD: Tolerating</span> ?][? if meck_stre_kpd == 0: KPD: Opposition ?]
[? if meck_stre_sapd == 2: <span style="color: [+ sapd_colour +];">SAPD: Tolerating</span> ?][? if meck_stre_sapd == 0: SAPD: Opposition ?]
[? if meck_stre_uspd == 2: <span style="color: [+ uspd_colour +];">USPD: Tolerating</span> ?][? if meck_stre_uspd == 0: USPD: Opposition ?]
[? if meck_stre_ddp == 2: <span style="color: [+ ddp_colour +];">[+ ddp_name +]: Tolerating</span> ?][? if meck_stre_ddp == 0: [+ ddp_name +]: Opposition ?]
[? if meck_stre_lvp == 2: <span style="color: [+ lvp_colour +];">LVP: Tolerating</span> ?][? if meck_stre_lvp == 0: LVP: Opposition ?]
[? if meck_stre_vhg == 2: <span style="color: #CEDD8A;">VHG: Tolerating</span> ?][? if meck_stre_vhg == 0: VHG: Opposition ?]

- @meck_stre_seek_kpd_toleration: Seek KPD Toleration
- @meck_stre_seek_sapd_toleration: Seek SAPD Toleration
- @meck_stre_seek_uspd_toleration: Seek USPD Toleration
- @meck_stre_seek_ddp_toleration: Seek [+ ddp_name +] Toleration
- @meck_stre_seek_lvp_toleration: Seek LVP Toleration
- @meck_stre_seek_vhg_toleration: Seek VHG Toleration
- @meck_stre_seek_others_toleration: Seek Others Toleration
- @meck_stre_seek_dvp_toleration: Seek DVP Toleration (unlikely)
- @meck_stre_remove_kpd_toleration: Remove KPD Toleration
- @meck_stre_remove_sapd_toleration: Remove SAPD Toleration
- @meck_stre_remove_uspd_toleration: Remove USPD Toleration
- @meck_stre_remove_ddp_toleration: Remove [+ ddp_name +] Toleration
- @meck_stre_remove_lvp_toleration: Remove LVP Toleration
- @meck_stre_remove_vhg_toleration: Remove VHG Toleration
- @meck_stre_remove_others_toleration: Remove Others Toleration
- @meck_stre_remove_dvp_toleration: Remove DVP Toleration
- @meck_stre_confirm_toleration: Confirm Toleration Arrangement
- @meck_stre_abandon_toleration: Abandon Minority Government

@meck_stre_seek_kpd_toleration
view-if: kpd_r_meck_stre > 0 and not meck_stre_kpd == 2
choose-if: kpd_relation >= 40 or (kpd_relation >= 25 and Q.ideology == "left")
subtitle: The KPD will demand radical concessions and may withdraw support unpredictably.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if kpd_relation < 25: Our relations with the KPD are too poor. ?][? if kpd_relation < 40 and not Q.ideology == "left": The KPD distrusts our moderate leadership. ?]
on-arrival: meck_stre_kpd = 2; meck_stre_coalition_r = meck_stre_coalition_r + kpd_r_meck_stre; meck_stre_election_2_trigger_time -= 8; kpd_relation -= 2; rural_spd -= 1; workers_spd -= 1
go-to: meck_stre_toleration_selection

@meck_stre_seek_sapd_toleration
view-if: sapd_r_meck_stre > 0 and not meck_stre_sapd == 2
choose-if: sapd_relation >= 35 or (sapd_relation >= 20 and Q.ideology == "left")
subtitle: The SAPD will demand socialist policies in exchange for toleration.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if sapd_relation < 20: Our relations with the SAPD are too poor. ?][? if sapd_relation < 35 and not Q.ideology == "left": The SAPD sees us as too bourgeois. ?]
on-arrival: meck_stre_sapd = 2; meck_stre_coalition_r = meck_stre_coalition_r + sapd_r_meck_stre; meck_stre_election_2_trigger_time -= 6; sapd_relation -= 1
go-to: meck_stre_toleration_selection

@meck_stre_seek_uspd_toleration
view-if: uspd_r_meck_stre > 0 and not meck_stre_uspd == 2
choose-if: uspd_relation >= 40 or (uspd_relation >= 30 and (uspd_ideology == "Orthodox Marxism" and not Q.ideology == "reformist"))
subtitle: [? if uspd_ideology == "Orthodox Marxism": The USPD's orthodox faction may be more willing to work with us. ?][? if not uspd_ideology == "Orthodox Marxism": The USPD will demand progressive reforms. ?]
unavailable-subtitle: [? if uspd_relation < 30: We need better relations with the USPD. ?]
on-arrival: meck_stre_uspd = 2; meck_stre_coalition_r = meck_stre_coalition_r + uspd_r_meck_stre; meck_stre_election_2_trigger_time -= 4; uspd_relation += 1
go-to: meck_stre_toleration_selection

@meck_stre_seek_ddp_toleration
view-if: ddp_r_meck_stre > 0 and not meck_stre_ddp == 2
choose-if: ddp_relation >= 30 or (ddp_relation >= 45 and Q.ideology == "left")
subtitle: [? if ddp_relation >= 65: The [+ ddp_name +] is sympathetic to our cause. ?][? if ddp_relation < 65: The [+ ddp_name +] will expect policy moderation. ?]
unavailable-subtitle: [? if ddp_relation < 30: The [+ ddp_name +] doesn't trust us enough. ?]
on-arrival: meck_stre_ddp = 2; meck_stre_coalition_r = meck_stre_coalition_r + ddp_r_meck_stre; meck_stre_election_2_trigger_time -= 2; ddp_relation += 2
go-to: meck_stre_toleration_selection

@meck_stre_seek_lvp_toleration
view-if: lvp_r_meck_stre > 0 and not meck_stre_lvp == 2
choose-if: lvp_relation >= 45 or (lvp_relation >= 55 and Q.ideology == "left")
subtitle: [? if lvp_relation >= 75: The LVP is quite friendly to us. ?][? if lvp_relation < 75: The LVP will demand liberal economic policies. ?]
unavailable-subtitle: [? if lvp_relation < 45: The LVP prefers bourgeois governments. ?]
on-arrival: meck_stre_lvp = 2; meck_stre_coalition_r = meck_stre_coalition_r + lvp_r_meck_stre; meck_stre_election_2_trigger_time -= 3; lvp_relation += 1
go-to: meck_stre_toleration_selection

@meck_stre_seek_vhg_toleration
view-if: vhg_r_meck_stre > 0 and not meck_stre_vhg == 2
choose-if: dvp_relation >= 50 and meck_stre_kpd == 0 and meck_stre_sapd == 0
subtitle: The VHG represents small property owners and will demand tax cuts.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if dvp_relation < 50: The VHG doesn't trust our economic policies. ?][? if meck_stre_kpd == 2 or meck_stre_sapd == 2: The VHG won't work with communists. ?]
on-arrival: meck_stre_vhg = 2; meck_stre_coalition_r = meck_stre_coalition_r + vhg_r_meck_stre; meck_stre_election_2_trigger_time -= 5; dvp_relation -= 2
go-to: meck_stre_toleration_selection

@meck_stre_seek_others_toleration
view-if: true_other_r_meck_stre > 0 and not meck_stre_true_others == 2
choose-if: ddp_relation >= 60 and dvp_relation >= 30
subtitle: The smaller parties are conservative but pragmatic.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if ddp_relation < 60: We need better relations with liberal parties first. ?]
on-arrival: meck_stre_true_others = 2; meck_stre_coalition_r = meck_stre_coalition_r + true_other_r_meck_stre; meck_stre_election_2_trigger_time -= 2
go-to: meck_stre_toleration_selection

@meck_stre_seek_dvp_toleration
view-if: dvp_r_meck_stre > 0 and not meck_stre_dvp == 2
choose-if: dvp_relation >= 70 and meck_stre_kpd == 0 and meck_stre_sapd == 0 and meck_stre_uspd == 0
subtitle: The DVP rarely tolerates SPD governments, but desperate times...
unavailable-subtitle: [? if dvp_relation < 70: The DVP would never tolerate us normally. ?][? if meck_stre_kpd == 2 or meck_stre_sapd == 2 or meck_stre_uspd == 2: The DVP won't work with Marxists. ?]
on-arrival: meck_stre_dvp = 2; meck_stre_coalition_r = meck_stre_coalition_r + dvp_r_meck_stre; meck_stre_election_2_trigger_time -= 10; dvp_relation -= 5; workers_dvp += 2
go-to: meck_stre_toleration_selection

@meck_stre_remove_kpd_toleration
view-if: meck_stre_kpd == 2
on-arrival: meck_stre_coalition_r = meck_stre_coalition_r - kpd_r_meck_stre; meck_stre_kpd = 0; meck_stre_election_2_trigger_time += 8; kpd_relation -= 3
go-to: meck_stre_toleration_selection

@meck_stre_remove_sapd_toleration
view-if: meck_stre_sapd == 2
on-arrival: meck_stre_coalition_r = meck_stre_coalition_r - sapd_r_meck_stre; meck_stre_sapd = 0; meck_stre_election_2_trigger_time += 6
go-to: meck_stre_toleration_selection

@meck_stre_remove_uspd_toleration
view-if: meck_stre_uspd == 2
on-arrival: meck_stre_coalition_r = meck_stre_coalition_r - uspd_r_meck_stre; meck_stre_uspd = 0; meck_stre_election_2_trigger_time += 4
go-to: meck_stre_toleration_selection

@meck_stre_remove_ddp_toleration
view-if: meck_stre_ddp == 2
on-arrival: meck_stre_coalition_r = meck_stre_coalition_r - ddp_r_meck_stre; meck_stre_ddp = 0; meck_stre_election_2_trigger_time += 2; ddp_relation -= 1
go-to: meck_stre_toleration_selection

@meck_stre_remove_lvp_toleration
view-if: meck_stre_lvp == 2
on-arrival: meck_stre_coalition_r = meck_stre_coalition_r - lvp_r_meck_stre; meck_stre_lvp = 0; meck_stre_election_2_trigger_time += 3
go-to: meck_stre_toleration_selection

@meck_stre_remove_vhg_toleration
view-if: meck_stre_vhg == 2
on-arrival: meck_stre_coalition_r = meck_stre_coalition_r - vhg_r_meck_stre; meck_stre_vhg = 0; meck_stre_election_2_trigger_time += 5
go-to: meck_stre_toleration_selection

@meck_stre_remove_others_toleration
view-if: meck_stre_true_others == 2
on-arrival: meck_stre_coalition_r = meck_stre_coalition_r - true_other_r_meck_stre; meck_stre_true_others = 0; meck_stre_election_2_trigger_time += 2
go-to: meck_stre_toleration_selection

@meck_stre_remove_dvp_toleration
view-if: meck_stre_dvp == 2
on-arrival: meck_stre_coalition_r = meck_stre_coalition_r - dvp_r_meck_stre; meck_stre_dvp = 0; meck_stre_election_2_trigger_time += 10
