@meck_stre_confirm_toleration
choose-if: meck_stre_coalition_r >= 50
subtitle: We have enough toleration support to govern!
unavailable-subtitle: We still don't have enough support. New elections may be necessary.
on-arrival: meck_stre_gov = "SPD-Minority"; meck_stre_election_2_trigger_time = meck_stre_election_2_trigger_time; meck_stre_toleration_active = 1
go-to: final_checkout_meck_stre

SPD Minority Government confirmed with toleration from supporting parties.

@meck_stre_abandon_toleration
on-arrival: meck_stre_spd = 0; meck_stre_kpd = 0; meck_stre_sapd = 0; meck_stre_uspd = 0; meck_stre_ddp = 0; meck_stre_lvp = 0; meck_stre_vhg = 0; meck_stre_true_others = 0; meck_stre_dvp = 0; meck_stre_election_2_trigger_time = time + 3; new_middle_dnvp += 2; new_middle_ddp -= 1
go-to: meck_stre_coalition_menu

We couldn't secure enough toleration. New elections have been called.

@meck_stre_tolerate_bourgeois_option
title: Tolerate a Bourgeois Government
subtitle: We'll allow a moderate bourgeois government to form in exchange for policy concessions.
choose-if: bourgeois_coalition_meck_stre >= 50 or thick_bourgeois_coalition_meck_stre >= 50
on-arrival: meck_stre_gov = "Bourgeois"; meck_stre_spd = 2; meck_stre_ddp = 1; meck_stre_dvp = 1; meck_stre_true_others = 1; meck_stre_lvp = 1; meck_stre_election_2_trigger_time = time + 25; unemployed_spd -= 2; rural_spd -= 1; workers_spd -= 1; ddp_relation += 3; dvp_relation += 1
go-to: final_checkout_meck_stre

We'll tolerate a bourgeois government led by the moderate parties. This may anger our more radical supporters but provides stability.
